### **6. README.md for Traps Lab**

# Xv6 Traps Lab 🐧

This lab is part of my journey through **MIT 6.1810 (Operating Systems)**, where I explored how system calls are implemented using traps in **xv6**. I implemented a backtrace feature for debugging and added a user-level alarm handler to periodically alert processes.

